# Witness: a pointer to a Structure written through an explicit path refuses an element that holds an int (4).
# Norm: the book #scope, journal 2026-11-17 #l3-own-types.
# Slice C1 (plan #one-graph-plan, P1): the check lives in src/l2src/lmx_checks.lm2.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        @: p 0
)
@: shared data[0]
sub: main () (A(int: v 1))
    shared\Observed\p := A[0]
    shared\Observed\seen := 1
main()
